# Remember to never publicly share your PRIVATE keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
# EXCEPTION: the sideload keystore is deliberately public. It only exists so
# every CI build carries the same signature and sideloaded updates install in
# place. It must NEVER be used for store releases — those use the private
# keystore configured via key.properties / CI secrets, which overrides it.
!/sideload.jks
